      "summary_en": "Locke readies a set of Soul Nails to throw, dealing damage to and marking enemies hit. Locke can consume the marks to deal bonus damage with his attacks.",
      "summary_zh": "洛克依次击出三颗驱魔大钉，对命中的敌人们造成伤害，并附上一层印记。洛克的攻击可以引爆印记，造成额外伤害。",
