      "summary_en": "Locke ignites his soul, gaining Attack Speed and Move Speed, and dealing damage to himself. At the end of the duration, Locke will heal back a portion of the damage he takes during the effect.",
      "summary_zh": "洛克点燃自己的灵魂，从而获得攻击速度和移动速度，但会不断对自身造成伤害。技能结束时，洛克将回复一部分在技能持续期间受到的伤害。",
